{"description":"((SUNDAY  SHOW))\nOWLS CLUB MUSIC HOUR's annual ...\nHALLOWEEN FREAK OUT!!!\nDrag the whole family over to Owls Club this pumpkin season because Bean Bag, Maestro Owl, and Jon have sackfuls of tricks and treats lined up for you and your little goblins!\nMusical mischief from The Animal Band + secret spooky guests will get your bones-a-shaking and have you howling along!\nCostumes highly encouraged!\nSuggested price $20 per adult, $10 per child\nTickets are sliding scale, choose the rate you're comfortable paying :)","organizer":"Bean Bag"}